\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The survey as searched, and the paper's headline numbers in one place. Every count quoted in this paper reconciles with it. The two completeness experiments measure different quantities and are kept in separate tables. Every frequency union quoted here is an aggregate over a clustered, repeatedly revisited coverage, whose actual distribution is Fig.\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {fig:waterfall}; the union should not be read as continuous coverage of its endpoints.}}{6}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
